  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Energy Access in Tanzania through Green Mini-Grids</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve access to clean, safe and reliable energy for Tanzanians, particularly the rural poor. This includes support for green mini-grids and technical assistance for energy access companies and project developers.</narrative>
  </description>
